 "engenn9le16ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Hey, Bianca. Where have you been?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: What do you mean where have I been? I was in the bathroom washing my hands.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Oh sorry. You didn't answer your phone.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: So, you aren't working yet, are you?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Not yet. Next  week, I'm going to go to a place called BFP for an interview and I think I like my chances there.  <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: BFP? That's a publishing house, isn't it?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Yeah! You've heard of them, haven't you?<br />", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn9le16ob03re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Oh yeah.  My friend Davis heard that BFP had a good standing as an up-and-coming company in the publishing world. You talked to them, didn't you?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>:  They sent an e-mail.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: What did they say?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: They are going to hire an editor assistant and they liked my qualifications.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: What else did the email say?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: They asked me when I could come in for an interview and I wrote back and said I could come in next week. I am going to take this week to prepare.<br />", "time": "28500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn9le16ob03re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: If you need any help preparing, I'll help you.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Thanks. Let's meet Thursday?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Sounds like a plan.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Adam is going to lend a hand as well. By the way, Adam always asks what you have been doing.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Ughh! You guys hang out a lot, don't you?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: He's going to be interviewing for jobs soon too and he needs some practice as well. What? He's not that bad.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Bianca</span>: Yeah. Well he's not that good either. Ask around. I will see you on Thursday though.<br />", "time": "58300", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}